n philanthropy.","short_summary":"Student organizations turn a community-voted theme into interactive displays with a charitable component.","evidence_claim":"Hofstra says student organizations construct interactive Pride Expo booths around a theme selected by student social-media voting and raise awareness and funds for philanthropy.","source_url":"https://www.hofstra.edu/student-leadership-engagement/programs-traditions.html","source_title":"Student Leadership & Engagement: Programs & Traditions","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Presented on the Saturday of Fall Festival; consult the current festival schedule for location and entry details.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hofstra-pride-court","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Hofstra Pride Court","title":"Vote Hofstra Royalty onto Pride Court","subtitle":"A senior showcase decided by audience ballots","notes":"Watch the Friday showcase before the four Hofstra Royalty members are announced Saturday; seniors should review the current candidacy instructions first.","short_summary":"Hofstra's homecoming court culminates in four royalty selections determined through audience voting.","evidence_claim":"Hofstra invites seniors to seek annual Pride Court candidacy, holds a Friday showcase, and announces four Hofstra Royalty members from audience votes on Saturday.","source_url":"https://www.hofstra.edu/student-leadership-engagement/programs-traditions.html","source_title":"Student Leadership & Engagement: Programs & Traditions","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The showcase typically occurs at 8 p.m. Friday of Fall Festival weekend, with royalty announced Saturday; verify the current schedule.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":tr