","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Annual service details are distributed through official Hofstra communications and Alumni Affairs; confirm the current time and location.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hofstra-celebrates-holidays","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Hofstra Celebrates the Holidays","title":"Read the Student Center's Painted Holiday Windows","subtitle":"Student organizations interpret worldwide observances","notes":"Walk the dining-room windows, read each group's interpretation, and join the accompanying crafts without treating distinct holidays as interchangeable.","short_summary":"Campus organizations transform Student Center windows into an educational display of celebrations from around the world.","evidence_claim":"Hofstra calls this an annual tradition in which student organizations paint Student Center dining-room windows to interpret holidays celebrated worldwide and create related crafts.","source_url":"https://www.hofstra.edu/student-leadership-engagement/programs-traditions.html","source_title":"Student Leadership & Engagement: Programs & Traditions","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The tradition takes place in the Student Center's main dining room; verify current display and reception dates through Hofstra events.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hofstra-spring-tulips","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Hofstra Spring Tulip Display","title":"Watch Hofstra Turn Dutch Heritage into Tulip Season","subtitle":"Tens of thousands of blooms spread across campus each spring","notes":"Tour the outdoor plantings in spring and photograph the displays in place; check campus updates because the university gives no exact pe